*search.title:              Enter search
*search.strreqMessage:      Enter search

*titlelabel.label:          Status/Title:
*titlelabel.left:           ChainLeft
*titlelabel.right:          ChainLeft
*titledisplay.left:         ChainLeft
*titledisplay.right:        ChainRight
